"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a> for $1,320\n</p><p>When placed on the property, It takes the appearance of a blue transparent cube that can be scaled up to 15x15 studs.  \n</p><p>It has the same functionality as water around the map, forcing your character into swimming when entered, but unlike regular water, <b>Boxed Water</b> does not take your oxygen away, making it unable to actually kill.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"2346452df8fbc978cf9eb11fa126919f\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:161px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Boxed_Water_Old-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:159px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Boxed_Water_Old.png\" title=\"Boxed Water Old.png (267 KB)\" style=\"height:159px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/68/Boxed_Water_Old.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240228172456\" title=\"Boxed Water Old.png (267 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Old appearance of Boxed Water\" height=\"159\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Boxed Water Old.png\" data-image-key=\"Boxed_Water_Old.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Old appearance of Boxed Water\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Boxed Water Old.png (267 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Old appearance of Boxed Water\" height=\"159\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Boxed Water Old.png\" data-image-key=\"Boxed_Water_Old.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Old appearance of Boxed Water\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/68/Boxed_Water_Old.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240228172456\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Old appearance of Boxed Water</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When initially added, Boxed Water could actually drown you, making it possible to make traps on your property.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902115626\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 73/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1752/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019441/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.151      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   26.151      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2237-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902115626 and revision id 9860. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Schematics","Structures"],"links":[{"title":"Illumine Designs","exists":true}],"images":["Missing_Image.png","Boxed_Water_Boxed.png","Boxed_Water_Old.png"]}
